---
import PlaygroundShell from '../components/PlaygroundShell.astro';
---
<PlaygroundShell title="Simulate it" hint="One place-an-order flow built four ways. Pick a design, then set the order rate and how long Payments is down, to see messages per order, how long the customer waits, who can be named from the publisher's code, and which orders fail or finish late.">
  <ol class="how">
    <li>Set <b>Design</b> to <b>Direct calls</b>: <b>10</b> messages per order and the customer is answered after <b>50 ms</b>. Set <b>Design</b> to <b>Choreographed events</b>: <b>8</b> messages, answered after <b>5 ms</b>, with the order done after <b>20 ms</b>. Set <b>Design</b> to <b>Everything an event</b>: <b>23</b> messages.</li>
    <li>Set <b>Orders per tick</b> to <b>2</b> and <b>Payments down for (ticks)</b> to <b>4</b>. In the table, <b>Direct calls</b> fail <b>8</b> orders, and <b>Orchestrated commands</b> fail <b>4</b> and finish <b>16</b>. Set <b>Design</b> to <b>Choreographed events</b>: <b>0</b> orders fail, <b>20</b> finish, the queue high-water is <b>8</b> and the last order is done at tick <b>11</b>.</li>
    <li>Set <b>Orders per tick</b> to <b>3</b> and <b>Payments down for (ticks)</b> to <b>8</b>. In the table, <b>Direct calls</b> fail <b>21</b> orders. With <b>Choreographed events</b> still selected, the queue reaches <b>21</b>, the longest wait is <b>8</b> ticks and the last order is done at tick <b>17</b>.</li>
    <li>Look at who knows the flow. <b>Direct calls</b> define it in <b>1</b> place and name <b>5</b> consumers. <b>Choreographed events</b> define it in <b>6</b> places and name <b>0</b>. Adding a fraud check leaves <b>2</b> subscribers to review there, and <b>3</b> for <b>Everything an event</b>.</li>
  </ol>
  <div class="pg arc" data-arc>
    <div class="pg-row">
      <label>Design <select class="pg-in" data-design>
        <option value="0" selected>Direct calls</option>
        <option value="1">Orchestrated commands</option>
        <option value="2">Choreographed events</option>
        <option value="3">Everything an event</option>
      </select></label>
      <label>Orders per tick <input class="pg-in" type="range" min="1" max="3" step="1" value="2" data-rate /> <span class="pg-mono" data-ratev></span></label>
      <label>Payments down for (ticks) <input class="pg-in" type="range" min="0" max="8" step="1" value="4" data-down /> <span class="pg-mono" data-downv></span></label>
    </div>
    <div class="pg-grid">
      <div class="pg-box" data-b1><h3>Messages per order</h3><span class="pg-mono" data-o1></span><span class="pg-note" data-n1></span></div>
      <div class="pg-box" data-b2><h3>Customer is answered after</h3><span class="pg-mono" data-o2></span><span class="pg-note" data-n2></span></div>
      <div class="pg-box" data-b3><h3>Order is done after</h3><span class="pg-mono" data-o3></span><span class="pg-note" data-n3></span></div>
      <div class="pg-box" data-b4><h3>Places that define the flow</h3><span class="pg-mono" data-o4></span><span class="pg-note" data-n4></span></div>
      <div class="pg-box" data-b5><h3>Consumers the publisher's code names</h3><span class="pg-mono" data-o5></span><span class="pg-note" data-n5></span></div>
      <div class="pg-box" data-b6><h3>Subscribers to review for a new step</h3><span class="pg-mono" data-o6></span><span class="pg-note" data-n6></span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="pg-grid">
      <div class="pg-box" data-b7><h3>Orders that fail</h3><span class="pg-mono" data-o7></span><span class="pg-note" data-n7></span></div>
      <div class="pg-box" data-b8><h3>Orders that finish</h3><span class="pg-mono" data-o8></span><span class="pg-note" data-n8></span></div>
      <div class="pg-box" data-b9><h3>Queue high-water</h3><span class="pg-mono" data-o9></span><span class="pg-note" data-n9></span></div>
      <div class="pg-box" data-b10><h3>Longest wait</h3><span class="pg-mono" data-o10></span><span class="pg-note" data-n10></span></div>
      <div class="pg-box" data-b11><h3>Last order done at tick</h3><span class="pg-mono" data-o11></span><span class="pg-note" data-n11></span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="pg-box" style="--c: var(--border)">
      <h3>The four designs side by side</h3>
      <div class="arc-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="The four designs"><table class="arc-table" data-table>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Design</th><th scope="col">Messages</th><th scope="col">Answered (ms)</th><th scope="col">Done (ms)</th><th scope="col">Failed</th><th scope="col">Finished</th><th scope="col">Queue high-water</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody></tbody>
      </table></div>
      <span class="pg-note">Failed, finished and queue high-water use the order rate and outage you set. Every hop costs 5 ms (an assumption). Payments handles 3 orders per tick when up, orders arrive for 10 ticks, and the orchestrator gives up on an order after 2 ticks of waiting. Here the orchestrator answers the customer only when the flow is done; an asynchronous workflow could answer at once.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</PlaygroundShell>
<script>
  import { query } from '../playground';
  type Msg = [string, string, string, boolean];
  type Design = { name: string; msgs: Msg[]; waits: boolean; named: boolean; driver: string; flow: string[]; fraudReview: string[]; outage: 'fail' | 'patient' | 'queue' };
  const HOP_MS = 5, CAPACITY = 3, ARRIVAL_TICKS = 10, OUTAGE_START = 3, PATIENCE = 2;
  const STEPS = ['Payments', 'Inventory', 'Shipping', 'Notify', 'Analytics'];

  const direct = (): Msg[] => STEPS.flatMap((s): Msg[] => [['Orders', s, 'call', true], [s, 'Orders', 'reply', false]]);
  const orchestrated = (): Msg[] => ([['Orders', 'Workflow', 'start', true]] as Msg[])
    .concat(STEPS.flatMap((s): Msg[] => [['Workflow', s, 'command', true], [s, 'Workflow', 'reply', false]]))
    .concat([['Workflow', 'Orders', 'done', false]] as Msg[]);
  const choreography = (): Msg[] => [
    ['Orders', 'Payments', 'OrderPlaced', true], ['Orders', 'Analytics', 'OrderPlaced', true], ['Orders', 'Notify', 'OrderPlaced', true],
    ['Payments', 'Inventory', 'PaymentTaken', true], ['Payments', 'Analytics', 'PaymentTaken', true],
    ['Inventory', 'Shipping', 'StockReserved', true],
    ['Shipping', 'Notify', 'Shipped', true], ['Shipping', 'Analytics', 'Shipped', true],
  ];
  function everythingAnEvent(): Msg[] {
    const m: Msg[] = [];
    for (const s of ['Payments', 'Analytics', 'Audit', 'Notify']) m.push(['Orders', s, 'OrderPlaced', true]);
    const chain = ['Payments', 'Inventory', 'Shipping', 'Notify'];
    chain.forEach((s, i) => {
      for (const w of ['Analytics', 'Audit']) m.push([s, w, 'Started', false]);
      const next = i + 1 < chain.length ? [chain[i + 1]] : [];
      for (const w of next.concat(['Analytics', 'Audit'])) m.push([s, w, 'Done', true]);
    });
    return m;
  }
  const DESIGNS: Design[] = [
    { name: 'Direct calls', msgs: direct(), waits: true, named: true, driver: 'Orders', flow: ['Orders'], fraudReview: [], outage: 'fail' },
    { name: 'Orchestrated commands', msgs: orchestrated(), waits: true, named: true, driver: 'Workflow', flow: ['Workflow'], fraudReview: [], outage: 'patient' },
    { name: 'Choreographed events', msgs: choreography(), waits: false, named: false, driver: 'Orders', flow: ['Orders', 'Payments', 'Inventory', 'Shipping', 'Notify', 'Analytics'], fraudReview: ['Analytics', 'Notify'], outage: 'queue' },
    { name: 'Everything an event', msgs: everythingAnEvent(), waits: false, named: false, driver: 'Orders', flow: ['Orders', 'Payments', 'Inventory', 'Shipping', 'Notify', 'Analytics', 'Audit'], fraudReview: ['Analytics', 'Audit', 'Notify'], outage: 'queue' },
  ];

  // The same model as the code samples.
  function depth(msgs: Msg[]) { // longest causal chain: a message follows an earlier one that arrived at its sender
    const d: number[] = [];
    msgs.forEach((m, j) => {
      d[j] = 1;
      for (let i = 0; i < j; i++) if (msgs[i][1] === m[0]) d[j] = Math.max(d[j], d[i] + 1);
    });
    return Math.max(...d);
  }
  function outage(mode: Design['outage'], rate: number, down: number) {
    const isDown = (t: number) => t >= OUTAGE_START && t < OUTAGE_START + down;
    let queue: number[] = [], failed = 0, done = 0, high = 0, last = 0, maxWait = 0;
    for (let t = 0; t < 40; t++) {
      const arrivals = t < ARRIVAL_TICKS ? rate : 0;
      for (let k = 0; k < arrivals; k++) {
        if (mode === 'fail' && isDown(t)) failed++;
        else if (mode === 'fail') { done++; last = Math.max(last, t); }
        else queue.push(t);
      }
      if (mode === 'patient') { const keep = queue.filter((a) => t - a <= PATIENCE); failed += queue.length - keep.length; queue = keep; }
      if (mode !== 'fail' && !isDown(t)) {
        const n = Math.min(CAPACITY, queue.length);
        for (const a of queue.slice(0, n)) { done++; maxWait = Math.max(maxWait, t - a); last = Math.max(last, t); }
        queue = queue.slice(n);
      }
      high = Math.max(high, queue.length);
    }
    return { failed, done, high, maxWait, last };
  }

  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-arc]').forEach((root) => {
    const q = query(root);
    const tbody = q('[data-table] tbody');
    const box = (n: number, good: boolean) => q<HTMLElement>(`[data-b${n}]`).style.setProperty('--c', good ? 'var(--good)' : 'var(--bad)');
    const set = (n: number, out: string, note: string) => { q(`[data-o${n}]`).textContent = out; q(`[data-n${n}]`).textContent = note; };
    function draw() {
      const di = Number(q<HTMLSelectElement>('[data-design]').value);
      const rate = Number(q<HTMLInputElement>('[data-rate]').value);
      const down = Number(q<HTMLInputElement>('[data-down]').value);
      q('[data-ratev]').textContent = String(rate);
      q('[data-downv]').textContent = String(down);
      const d = DESIGNS[di];
      const hops = depth(d.msgs);
      const resp = d.waits ? hops : 1;
      const named = d.named ? new Set(d.msgs.filter((m) => m[3] && m[0] === d.driver).map((m) => m[1])).size : 0;
      const o = outage(d.outage, rate, down);
      set(1, String(d.msgs.length), 'every message is a place to lose, delay or duplicate something');
      box(1, d.msgs.length <= 10);
      set(2, `${resp * HOP_MS} ms`, `${resp} hops at ${HOP_MS} ms each (an assumption)${d.waits ? ': the caller waits for the whole flow' : ': answered once the event is accepted'}`);
      box(2, resp <= 5);
      set(3, `${hops * HOP_MS} ms`, `${hops} hops until the last step has run`);
      box(3, hops <= 10);
      set(4, String(d.flow.length), d.flow.length === 1 ? 'one file shows the whole sequence' : 'handlers in these services together make the flow: ' + d.flow.join(', '));
      box(4, d.flow.length <= 1);
      set(5, String(named), d.named ? 'the caller lists who it calls, so a search finds them' : 'subscribers register elsewhere: the publisher cannot list them');
      box(5, d.named);
      set(6, String(d.fraudReview.length), d.fraudReview.length === 0 ? 'the new step is added in one place' : 'still receive the event for orders that the new step may reject: ' + d.fraudReview.join(', '));
      box(6, d.fraudReview.length === 0);
      set(7, String(o.failed), o.failed === 0 ? 'nothing is lost' : 'orders the customer sees as errors');
      box(7, o.failed === 0);
      set(8, String(o.done), `of ${rate * ARRIVAL_TICKS} orders placed`);
      box(8, o.done === rate * ARRIVAL_TICKS);
      set(9, String(o.high), d.outage === 'fail' ? 'no queue: callers fail at once' : 'orders waiting for Payments');
      box(9, o.high <= 4);
      set(10, `${o.maxWait} ticks`, 'time a finished order waited for Payments');
      box(10, o.maxWait <= 2);
      set(11, String(o.last), 'the tick when the last finished order was completed');
      box(11, o.last <= 12);
      tbody.textContent = '';
      DESIGNS.forEach((x, i) => {
        const h = depth(x.msgs);
        const r = outage(x.outage, rate, down);
        const row = document.createElement('tr');
        if (i === di) row.className = 'sel';
        [x.name, String(x.msgs.length), String((x.waits ? h : 1) * HOP_MS), String(h * HOP_MS), String(r.failed), String(r.done), String(r.high)].forEach((text, k) => {
          const cell = document.createElement(k === 0 ? 'th' : 'td'); if (k === 0) cell.setAttribute('scope', 'row'); cell.textContent = text; row.appendChild(cell);
        });
        tbody.appendChild(row);
      });
    }
    root.addEventListener('input', draw);
    root.addEventListener('change', draw);
    draw();
  });
</script>
<style is:global>
  .playground .arc-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .playground .arc-table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: .85rem; }
  .playground .arc-table th, .playground .arc-table td { padding: 5px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); text-align: left; }
  .playground .arc-table tr.sel { background: var(--accent-soft); font-weight: 600; }
</style>
